  m_text: 'A Unity template for making Sonic Fangames. Featuring effects, objects,
    utilities, and SONIC.


    Here''s a big open space to mess around. Touch the
    hint rings for tips on the controls, actions and systems. Once you''re happy,
    head on over to Altitude Limit or Rail Canyon for some action.


    Please consider
    forking the GitHub to make your own sonic levels, and join the Flipper Framework
    Discord.'
