      propertyPath: 'hintText.Array.data[0]'
      value: On completing a stage, you are graded on two things. Your time and your
        rings, from S - D each.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 17082088799462264, guid: 586759ae0860528419c2b7f6755e3c04,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'hintText.Array.data[1]'
      value: The ranks are combined together (AB, SC, etc), meaning the ultimate
        ranking (SS) requires speed, efficient pathing to collect rings and levelling
        up to hold enough rings.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 17082088799462264, guid: 586759ae0860528419c2b7f6755e3c04,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'hintText.Array.data[2]'
      value: If you just want to Speedrun though, there is also the secret X rank,
        based only on time.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 17082088799462264, guid: 586759ae0860528419c2b7f6755e3c04,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'hintText.Array.data[3]'
      value: The rank requirements in this build are intentionally very very tough,
